OL,3,ATrump at residence of Irish president
OL,4,Afor Ireland visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has arrived
OL,7,Ffor a two-day visit to Ireland.
OL,9,FHe has arrived at the Aras an
OL,10,FUachtarain to hold a courtesy call with
OL,11,FIrish President Catherine Connolly and
OL,12,Fwill have a meeting with Taoiseach
OL,13,F(Irish Prime Minister) Micheal Martin
OL,14,Flater on Saturday morning.
OL,16,FHe was greeted by Tanaiste (Irish
OL,17,Fdeputy prime minister) Simon Harris and
OL,18,FIrish Foreign Minister Helen McEntee at
OL,19,FDublin Airport.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
