OL,3,ATrump at residence of Irish president
OL,4,Afor Ireland visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe will attend events at the US
OL,7,FAmbassador to Ireland's residence in
OL,8,FPhoenix Park, before attending the
OL,9,FAmgen Irish Open golf tournament which
OL,10,Fis taking place at the Trump
OL,11,FInternational Golf Links and Hotel
OL,12,FDoonbeg in County Clare, which he owns.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
